      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The site sits along the historic Old Spanish Trail and showcases over 1,000 years of cultural history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nps.gov/places/los-luceros.htm",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Indigenous, Hispanic, and Anglo‑American cultures have blended here, shaping both history and the landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nps.gov/places/los-luceros.htm",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 19th‑century Hacienda, the ranch’s centerpiece, is currently closed for restoration until late summer 2025.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://nmhistoricsites.org/los-luceros",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The property also hosts a 19th‑century chapel, Victorian cottage, guesthouse, and preserved farmyard.",
